ty it's a whole different  elements at least three people are  missing is the flames spread to Redding  children and their great grandmother and  so far two people have died a Redding  firefighter and a bulldozer operator  when Chris Corona returned to his family  home this was all that's left this is my  house since I was born  what's it like to see it now ruff  you know this fire was so hot you can  barely even tell that this was a home  behind me here you can make out the  washer and dryer here but that's about  it  it was these gusty winds and triple  digit temperatures that have been  fueling this fire  the winds are calming down a little bit  so that is some good news but the  temperatures are expected to remain over  100 degrees for the next week Michelle  no let-up Carter Evans in Redding  California thank you
 

